    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>StarNomads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship. Gather resources. Build weapons. Upgrade. Colonize planets. Protect your mothership. Destroy your enemies. In this Real-Time Strategy, Turn-Based, Roguelike game, you command a spaceship seeking to colonize various planets with hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, gather resources, build weapons and equipment, and make various upgrades that can take you further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1743405161\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op with up to four players, or in arena mode with up to eight players in frantic battles for planet colonization and resource domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets feature varied environments with unique obstacles. A new challenge every round. Build your strategy based on the obstacles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship and weapon upgrades are limitless. Create strategies based on long-range damage, close-range combat, movement speed, or a mix of everything.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>StarNomads</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your ship. Gather resources. Build weapons. Upgrade. Colonize planets. Protect your mothership. Destroy your enemies. In this Real-Time Strategy, Turn-Based, Roguelike game, you command a spaceship seeking to colonize various planets with hostile environments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, gather resources, build weapons and equipment, and make various upgrades that can take you further and further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171060/extras/48ed4063fe4483d898f7841d0725fa25.avif?t=1743405161\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, in co-op with up to four players, or in arena mode with up to eight players in frantic battles for planet colonization and resource domination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Diverse Environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planets feature varied environments with unique obstacles. A new challenge every round. Build your strategy based on the obstacles ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlimited Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ship and weapon upgrades are limitless. Create strategies based on long-range damage, close-range combat, movement speed, or a mix of everything.</p>",
    "short_description": "Choose your ship, gather resources, build weapons, and upgrade. Colonize planets, protect your mothership, and destroy enemies in strategic combat. A multiplayer RTS roguelike with turn-based battles!",
